#~ msgid ""
#~ "typing;trainer;touch typing;keyboard;speed;wpm;words per "
#~ "minute;accuracy;test;"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "matn terish;murabbiy;ko‘r usulda yozish;klaviatura;tezlik;dss;daqiqadagi "
#~ "so‘zlar soni;aniqlik;sinov;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no doubt that typing on a keyboard is an essential skill in the "
#~ "digital age. Typing fast and accurately gives you more opportunities, "
#~ "more time for what matters to you, and a sense of self-accomplishment."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Klaviaturada matn terish raqamli asrda muhim mahorat ekanligiga shubha "
#~ "yoʻq. Tez va toʻgʻri matn terish sizga koʻproq imkoniyatlar beradi. Siz "
#~ "uchun muhim boʻlgan narsalarga koʻproq vaqt va oʻz-oʻzini kamol toptirish "
#~ "hissini beradi."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch lets you practice typing. Thanks to fast-paced sessions with "
#~ "instant feedback afterwards and a plethora of available languages, you "
#~ "might even have a little fun doing so. With determination, proper "
#~ "technique and some time, you will observe a noticeable increase in both "
#~ "the speed and the accuracy of which your thoughts and ideas are put into "
#~ "words on the screen."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keypunch sizga matn terishni mashq qilish imkonini beradi. Tezkor "
#~ "sessiyalar va ulardan keyin tezkor fikr-mulohazalar hamda mavjud "
#~ "tillarning koʻpligi tufayli, siz buni bajarishdan biroz zavqlanishingiz "
#~ "mumkin. Qatʼiyat, toʻgʻri texnika va ma’lum vaqt o‘tgach, siz "
#~ "fikrlaringiz va g‘oyalaringizni ekranda so‘zlarga aylantirish tezligi va "
#~ "aniqligining sezilarli darajada oshganini kuzatasiz."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are already a racer at typing, Keypunch still has something for "
#~ "you. Try practicing with numbers and punctuation, or choose your own text "
#~ "to type out as fast as you can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Agar siz allaqachon matn terishda mohir bo‘lsangiz, Keypunchʼda hali ham "
#~ "siz uchun nimadir bor. Raqamlar va tinish belgilari bilan mashq qiling "
#~ "yoki imkon qadar tezroq yozish uchun o‘z matningizni tanlang."

#~ msgid "Get ready to accelerate your typing!"
#~ msgstr "Yozishni tezlashtirishga tayyorlaning!"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch is proudly part of GNOME Circle, an initiative that champions "
#~ "the great software that is available for the GNOME platform. For more "
